# Design — the blog brand sheet

The blog's look: a clean, light editorial theme for reading — generous measure, real type hierarchy,
a quiet sidebar of posts. Styles the nexus's generic site classes (`.wb-*`, `.prose`); the runtime
ships none of this. A calm reading surface, distinct from the dark product docs.

design :blog do
  @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Fraunces:opsz,wght@9..144,400;9..144,500;9..144,600&family=Inter:wght@400;500;600&family=Geist+Mono:wght@500&display=swap');

  :root{
    --bg:#faf8f3; --paper:#fff; --ink:#23201b; --soft:#6b6457; --line:#e9e3d6; --accent:#b9521f;
    --serif:'Fraunces',Georgia,serif; --sans:'Inter',system-ui,sans-serif; --mono:'Geist Mono',monospace;
  }
  body{background:var(--bg);color:var(--ink);font-family:var(--sans)}
  .wb-side{width:250px;border-right:1px solid var(--line);background:transparent}
  .wb-brand{font-family:var(--serif);font-weight:600;font-size:21px;letter-spacing:-.01em;color:var(--ink)}
  .wb-sec-title{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#a89f8c}
  .wb-link{color:var(--soft);font-size:15px;border-radius:7px}
  .wb-link:hover{background:#f1ece1;color:var(--ink)}
  .wb-link.on{background:#f1ece1;color:var(--ink);font-weight:600;box-shadow:inset 2px 0 0 var(--accent)}
  .wb-main{max-width:680px;padding:64px 40px 120px}

  .prose h1{font-family:var(--serif);font-size:40px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:-.02em;line-height:1.1;margin:0 0 .4em}
  .prose h2{font-family:var(--serif);font-size:24px;font-weight:600;margin:1.8em 0 .5em;border:0;padding:0}
  .prose p{font-size:18px;line-height:1.75;color:#2e2a23;margin:0 0 1.1em}
  .prose blockquote{font-family:var(--serif);font-size:21px;font-style:italic;color:var(--soft);border-left:3px solid var(--accent);margin:1.2em 0 1.4em;padding:.2em 0 .2em 1em;background:none}
  .prose em{font-style:italic} .prose strong{font-weight:600;color:var(--ink)}
  .prose a{color:var(--accent);border-bottom:1px solid #e7c4b3} .prose a:hover{border-color:var(--accent)}
  /* the date/byline line — a muted mono caption right under the dek */
  .prose p em:only-child, .prose p:nth-of-type(1) em{font-family:var(--mono)}
end
